<div class="command-authorization" role="img" aria-label="Authenticated HTTP flow. CancelOwnedOrder and caller claims reach the signed-in access gate. No stops with 401. Yes reaches a decision supplied with recorded order state. A different owner is rejected without an event. An eligible owner produces OrderCancelled.">
  <div class="node" data-diagram-role="command">CancelOwnedOrder + caller claims</div>
  <div class="connection">Auth-enabled HTTP</div>
  <div class="node">Access gate: signed in?</div>
  <div class="branches">
    <div class="connection">Yes</div>
    <div class="failure"><span aria-hidden="true">×</span> No: 401<br />Decision not reached</div>
  </div>
  <div class="state">Recorded order: owner + status</div>
  <div class="connection">Load order for the decision</div>
  <div class="node">Decision: owner matches and order can be cancelled?</div>
  <div class="branches">
    <div class="connection">Yes</div>
    <div class="failure"><span aria-hidden="true">×</span> No: reject<br />No event</div>
  </div>
  <div class="node" data-diagram-role="event">OrderCancelled</div>
</div>
